WEBVTT

00:14:29.698 --> 00:14:31.976
But I'd want one
who would play offense, too.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.277
I'd want him to be unselfish,

00:14:34.301 --> 00:14:37.444
and look for the pass first
and not shoot all the time.

00:14:37.468 --> 00:14:40.580
And I'd want one
that could pass and would pass.

00:14:40.604 --> 00:14:41.801
(Laughter)

00:14:41.825 --> 00:14:43.745
I've had some that could and wouldn't,

00:14:43.769 --> 00:14:45.871
and I've had some that would and could.

00:14:45.895 --> 00:14:47.530
(Laughter)

00:14:47.554 --> 00:14:48.976
So, yeah, I'd want that.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.777
And I wanted them to be able
to shoot from the outside.

00:14:52.801 --> 00:14:55.158
I wanted them to be good inside too.

00:14:55.182 --> 00:14:56.976
(Laughter)

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.976
I'd want them to be able
to rebound well at both ends, too.